## User

Check whether a list reads the same forwards and backwards.

## Type

type
```haskell
isPalindrome :: Eq a => [a] -> Bool
```

## Term

```haskell
isPalindrome xs = xs == reverse xs
```

## ghc

```haskell
isPalindrome' :: Eq a => [a] -> Bool
```

## ghc

```haskell
